            "author_1": "Sarah [stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/480738564_2096801550741012_1194647293592967283_n.jpg",
            "text_1": "<p>My husband and I tried this too! We totally noticed a difference in energy - lasted all day! We put it in our coffee or smoothies and you can't even taste it. Definitely a natural pick-me-up!</p>",
            "author_2": "<em>Author</em> [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/190815916_1338240019965748_8213006408721197660_n.jpg",
            "text_2": "<p>...<em><strong>I've never felt more alive!</strong></em>This stuff really has made the difference that I have been needing. I was not expecting it to have such an impact on my energy. Good service, and good resin. I felt the effects more in the third week or so. Cheers.</p>",
            "author_3": "<em>Author</em> [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/472711970_3073610409453859_6658616887979895788_n.jpg",
            "text_3": "<p>An incredible way to start your day is with<br/>shilajit. We're getting less and less minerals from our diet these days. There are over 80 minerals in shilajit. It's also great for hormones, brain function & energy.</p>",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 24
          }
        },
