            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": false,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>✔️ We <em>don't charge</em> over $0.85 per day <strong>unlike other brands.</strong></p><p>✔️ Our Shilajit Resin <strong>lasts for 90 days</strong>, not just 20-30 days like the ones advertised by others.</p><p>✔️ <strong>You get our e-book for FREE</strong> to enhance your own understanding of this thousand-year-old Ayurvedic remedy known as, \"The Destroyer of Weakness\".</p><p>✔️ We have <strong>NATA-Approved</strong> <strong>Australian lab tests</strong>, <em>instead of</em> supplier-provided lab tests that are from years ago.</p><p>✔️ Our Shilajit Resin has <strong>70% Fulvic Acid</strong> - not under 60% like other brands.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CL6cDy": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Is Your Shilajit Purified?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Psychiatry",
            "filled_icon": false,
