        "collapsible_tab_3RrKXn": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's In \"Fulvic Acid\"?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Psychiatry",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Social media, other websites, or health stores may have brought your attention to fulvic acid, a group of compounds that form in plants, and that animals can break down.<br/><br/>Several studies report numerous benefits of fulvic acid, not limited to, but includes:</p><p>✅ Naturally lowers cholesterol</p><p>✅ Naturally improve muscle strength</p><p>✅ Naturally elevates brain function</p><p>✅ Naturally relieves altitude sickness</p><p>✅ Naturally boosts energy</p><p>✅ Naturally has anti-cancer properties</p><p>✅ Naturally enhances gut health</p><p>✅ May slow down aging</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_GWtnTk": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Do You Use Shilajit?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Psychiatry",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We recommend taking 1 spoon of our Pure Shilajit resin everyday.<br/><br/>All orders include a <strong>custom</strong> spoon that's perfect for a serving size.<br/><br/>So once a day, every day, for at least 30 days.</p><p>You'll feel it, we promise.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
