    "collapsible_content_9A6q9h": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_gYe4kR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why buy from Wellness ? What makes you different?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>You should only believe what you can actually see and feel. And the only way you can do that is by trying Wellness Nest's Shilajit Resin for yourself!</p><p>✅ Our Shilajit stands out with <strong>78% Fulvic acid content, far surpassing the typical 60%</strong> or below offered by other brands.</p><p>...while <strong>other brands often lack current lab results</strong> <strong>and still charge over $5 per day</strong>, Wellness Nest ensures you receive supreme quality, purity, and exceptional value.<br/><br/>✅ We charge less than $2 per day, and our Shilajit is verified by 3rd party labs in Australia—and <strong>every 6 months, batches are independently verified again</strong> to ensure consistent quality.</p><p>...<strong>competitors lack up-to-date lab results and yet charge more than $5 per serving!<br/><br/></strong>✅ And with over 20,000+ people that have already felt the positive benefits of our Shilajit resin...</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rm9mW6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where is your Shilajit from?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Our shilajit is sourced from India directly from the pristine Uttarakhand Himalayas, known for its rich deposits of this natural substance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_48CNC6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in \"Fulvic Acid\"?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Social media, other websites, or health stores may have brought your attention to fulvic acid, <strong>a group of compounds that form in plants, and that animals can break down.<br/></strong><br/>Several studies report numerous benefits of fulvic acid, not limited to, but includes:</p><p>✅ Naturally lowers cholesterol</p><p>✅ Naturally improve muscle strength</p><p>✅ Naturally elevates brain function</p><p>✅ Naturally relieves altitude sickness</p><p>✅ Naturally boosts energy</p><p>✅ Naturally has anti-cancer properties</p><p>✅ Naturally enhances gut health</p><p>✅ May slow down aging</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NG3DpW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is your Shilajit resin pure? And how pure are we talking?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Our Shilajit is 100% pure and ethically sourced, we even went as far as having it 3rd party tested (semi-annually) in NATA-Accredited labs in Australia for full transparency—that's also up to date.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RA7jU6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are your lab-test results?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "",
            "page": "lab-certificate"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KijFbD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Is Your Shilajit Purified?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Wellness Nest' Shilajit is purified using the ancient method called \"SURYA TAPI\"..<br/><br/><strong>What is</strong> <strong>SURYA TAPI?</strong><br/><br/><strong>SURYA TAPI</strong> means <em><strong>Sun Dried..</strong></em></p><p>It's the <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>most natural</strong></span> method of purifying Shilajit, and it's also the <strong>best way to preserve Shilajit's potency, minerals & vitamins.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4gJfza": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will it take to work?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The time it takes for Shilajit to work can vary depending on several factors, including the individual's overall health, and dosage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LanAzm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I just eat it? Does it taste bad?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Our Shilajit is 3rd party, lab tested for purity and potency. It has 70% fulvic acid. It has a strong naturally earthy taste that we recommend you mix with warm water, or other liquids like warm milk.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ngtfLF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can women also take Shilajit resin?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Of course, it may help with fertility, immunity, digestion... and a lot more! It contains over 84 minerals & vitamins.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yaXXz4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is your Shilajit halal?",
            "icon": "event_note",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes it is! Our shilajit is Halal friendly!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
